Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "avatar_url": "https://teste3.com"
}

###

PATCH http://localhost:5000/profiles/{{profileId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "role": "admin"
}

